---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Web Design in Sioux Falls, SD | Couch & Craft"
description: "Websites for Sioux Falls service businesses, built by Justin Couch. Clear prices up front, and I write the copy for you."
cta: false
---
{%- set hofba = site.work | findBySlug("hall-of-fame-billiard-academy") -%}
<section class="hero band--navy" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__text flow">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.business.founder }} · Web design in {{ site.business.city }}, {{ site.business.state }}</p>
      <h1 id="hero-heading">Your work is good. Your website should <em>prove it.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">I plan, write, design and build websites for service businesses around {{ site.business.city }}. Then I help make sure the calls they bring in get answered.</p>
      <p class="hero__actions">
        <a class="button button--gold" href="/start/" data-track="cta_click" data-label="home-hero-start">Start a project</a>
        <a class="button button--secondary" href="/teardown/" data-track="cta_click" data-label="home-hero-teardown">Get a free teardown</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__photo">
      <div class="photo-needed" role="img" aria-label="Photo of Justin coming soon"><p>[NEEDS REAL PHOTO: Justin's headshot, cropped to remove the shirt logo]</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band home-proof" aria-labelledby="proof-heading">
  <div class="container flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-l)">
    <h2 id="proof-heading">Same instructor. Same 50 years of teaching. <em>New website.</em></h2>
    <div class="home-proof__grid">
      <div>
        {% set compare = { id: "home-compare", label: "Slide to compare Randy's old Wix site with his new one", before: "hofba-before-desktop", after: null, afterMissing: "[NEEDS: HOFBA live URL for the after screenshot]" } %}
        {% include "partials/before-after.njk" %}
      </div>
      <div class="home-proof__phone">
        {% set annotation = annotations["hofba-before-mobile"] %}{% set pinsSizes = "(min-width: 1024px) 16rem, 70vw" %}
        {% include "partials/pins.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="home-proof__after-notes">[COPY: 3 to 4 specific decisions from the HOFBA build, as pins on the after screenshot]</p>
    <p><a class="text-link" href="/work/{{ hofba.slug }}/">Read how it came together</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--white familiar" aria-labelledby="familiar-heading">
  <div class="container familiar__inner">
    <h2 id="familiar-heading">Sound familiar?</h2>
    <ul class="familiar__list">
      <li>You get more calls from Facebook than from your website.</li>
      <li>You'd rather not send a big customer to your site.</li>
      <li>You're not sure anyone ever fills out the contact form.</li>
      <li>You paid for a site once, and the person who built it stopped answering.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band services" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
  <div class="container flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-l)">
    <h2 id="services-heading">What I do</h2>
    <div class="services__grid">
      <article class="services__item services__item--lead">
        <p class="eyebrow">Web design</p>
        <h3><a href="/web-design/">Websites</a></h3>
        <p>A site that explains what you do, shows your work and makes it easy to call you. I write the words, so you don't have to.</p>
        <p><a class="text-link" href="/web-design/">How I build websites</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="services__item">
        <p class="eyebrow">Marketing</p>
        <h3><a href="/marketing/">Getting found</a></h3>
        <p>Google Business Profile, local search and a short monthly report on calls and leads.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="services__item">
        <p class="eyebrow">Lead response</p>
        <h3><a href="/lead-response/">Answering missed calls</a></h3>
        <p>When you can't pick up, the caller gets a text in seconds and a way to book.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--white work-strip" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
  <div class="container flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-l)">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="work-heading">Sites I've built</h2>
      <a class="text-link" href="/work/">All work</a>
    </div>
    <div class="work-grid">
      {%- for entry in site.work | published %}
      {% include "partials/work-card.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/process.njk" %}

<section class="band band--navy price-band" aria-labelledby="price-heading">
  <div class="container price-band__inner">
    <h2 id="price-heading" class="price-band__text">Websites start at {{ site.pricing.foundationFrom | open }}. Most full builds land around {{ site.pricing.signatureTypical | open }}.</h2>
    <a class="button button--gold" href="/pricing/" data-track="cta_click" data-label="home-price-band">See pricing</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band meet" aria-labelledby="meet-heading">
  <div class="container meet__inner">
    <div class="meet__photo">
      <div class="photo-needed" role="img" aria-label="Photo of Justin coming soon"><p>[NEEDS REAL PHOTO: Justin's headshot]</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow">
      <h2 id="meet-heading">Who you'll be working with</h2>
      <p class="lead">I'm Justin. I live in {{ site.business.city }} and build websites for people who'd rather be doing their real job. You'll deal with me from the first call to launch day, and after.</p>
      <p class="review-note">[JUSTIN TO REVIEW in his own words]</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">More about me</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="band band--white">
  <div class="container">
    {%- set faqs = [
      { q: "How much does a website cost?", a: "<p>Websites start at " + (site.pricing.foundationFrom | open) + ". Most full builds land around " + (site.pricing.signatureTypical | open) + ". <a href=\"/pricing/\">See what's in each price</a>.</p>" },
      { q: "How long does it take?", a: "<p>[JUSTIN TO SET: typical timeline, matching the process weeks]</p>" },
      { q: "Do I own my website?", a: "<p>" + (site.pricing.ownershipPolicy | open) + "</p>" },
      { q: "Do you use AI?", a: "<p>Yes, for parts of the work, like research and first drafts. I check, rewrite and test everything myself before you see it. Nothing goes live that I haven't read.</p>" },
      { q: "What happens after launch?", a: "<p>You pick. Stay on the Care &amp; Growth plan and I keep working on your Google listing and send a short monthly report on calls and leads. Or I hand the site off with a how-to guide so you can run it yourself.</p>" }
    ] -%}
    {% set faqId = "home-faq" %}{% set faqHeading = "Questions people ask" %}
    {% include "partials/faq.njk" %}
  </div>
</div>

<section class="band home-form" aria-labelledby="home-form-heading">
  <div class="container home-form__inner">
    <div class="flow">
      <h2 id="home-form-heading">Tell me what's not working.</h2>
      <p>A few details and I'll take it from there.{% if site.contact.responseTime | isSet %} I reply within {{ site.contact.responseTime }}.{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    {% set form = { id: "home-form", type: "project" } %}
    {% include "partials/form.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
